---
const portraitUrl = "/images/about/about-pp.png";
const poolUrl = "/images/about/about-pool.jpg";
const yellowUrl = "/images/about/about-yellow.jpg";
const aboutUrl = "/images/about/about-italy.jpg";
const galleryUrl = "/images/about/italy-about.jpg";
---

<section id="about" class="section-container">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <img
        src={yellowUrl}
        alt="Butter yellow outfit street photography"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/5]"
      />
      <img
        src={poolUrl}
        alt="Celina by the pool, shot on film-like summer light"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/5] mt-12"
      />
      <img
        src={portraitUrl}
        alt="Celina Sguazzino portrait"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/5] col-span-2 mt-3 mb-3"
      />
      <img
        src={aboutUrl}
        alt="Celina in a portrait-style editorial image"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/5]"
      />
      <img
        src={galleryUrl}
        alt="Additional portrait photography of Celina"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/5] mt-12"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
      <h3 class="section-header" data-i18n="about.heading">about me</h3>
      <p
        class="font-sans text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-snug text-foreground mb-8"
        data-i18n="about.intro"
      >
        I’m Celina, <br /> a multimedia designer based in Kongens Lyngby, Denmark.
      </p>
      <p
        class="text-base md:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6"
        data-i18n="about.paragraphOne"
      >
        I work across digital design, UX/UI, branding, graphic design,
        photography, and web development. I enjoy bringing ideas to life through
        a mix of visual storytelling, creative thinking, and technology. Whether
        I’m designing a visual identity, building a digital experience, creating
        imagery, or writing code, I’m always looking for the balance between
        creativity, functionality, and a strong visual expression.
      </p>
      <p
        class="text-base md:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"
        data-i18n="about.paragraphTwo"
      >
        I’m curious, detail-oriented, and always eager to learn, experiment, and
        take on new creative challenges. As I continue developing my skills, I’m
        looking forward to collaborating with people and brands that value
        thoughtful and engaging design.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
